stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed: change proposal with evidence
  Proposed --> ClinicalReview: accepted for review
  ClinicalReview --> TechnicalValidation: clinical sign-off
  ClinicalReview --> Proposed: changes requested
  TechnicalValidation --> SecondReview: tests pass on fixed case set
  TechnicalValidation --> Proposed: defects found
  SecondReview --> Approved: independent reviewer agrees
  SecondReview --> Proposed: changes requested
  Approved --> Released: version tagged, effective date set
  Released --> Monitoring: live
  Monitoring --> PeriodicReview: scheduled date reached
  Monitoring --> RolledBack: safety signal or defect
  PeriodicReview --> Proposed: change needed
  PeriodicReview --> Monitoring: re-affirmed
  RolledBack --> Monitoring: previous approved version restored
  Released --> Retired: superseded or expired
  Retired --> [*]
